{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban all loud fireworks and only allow silent ones to be sold in the UK",
        "additional_details": "As we are coming to the end of the year it is becoming a nightly occurrence of continuous loud fireworks and with events such as the bonfire night and new year, more and more fireworks are being let off by the general public days before these events. This petition is to stress the level of unneeded distress that loud fireworks can cause to both animals and those who suffer from PTSD. This petition is to stress that silent fireworks MUST be mandatory and only silent fireworks should be sold.",
        "background": "Ban all loud fireworks and allow only silent fireworks to be sold to both the public and organised events in the UK. \r\n\r\nLoud fireworks can cause unnecessary distress to animals and those who suffer from PTSD etc. I have seen both animals and humans alike go into shock and take days to recover.",
